{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：细腻具体的音乐感受明显不如X，尤其是音乐细节的先后变化、力度层次、音色质感和人物感受之间的微妙对应，被压缩成了较概括的短词。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的左右分栏让观众可以一边抓住完整叙事，一边快速扫到对应的音乐感受，人物每一步为什么动摇、怀念、犹豫和重新作决定也交代得更清楚，前后形成了连续的心理过程。X的优势是感受描写更丰富、更有时间层次，尤其能捕捉音乐细微变化及其带来的复杂情绪，但大量感受词连续出现，容易让观众把注意力花在辨认局部细节上。综合普通观众边听边看的实际体验，我选Y，但它确实牺牲了一部分细腻度。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cd17fd4b-bf62-4353-9d00-35b9161c6047", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T090404681745Z", "elapsed_seconds": 34.734, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T09:04:39.438782+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "196c8b08c52ae1f8cc112a0c1710e85b8ec93fc882a6271457266a606a517981", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\